==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Rose Garden Witch]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

